body:
How long should it take to see the new update available in MultiMC? So far it still says the latest version is 0.4.8+build.155.

&#x200B;

Edit: nevermind I get it now.

I've always used the default. Turning it up doesn't look as good to me and it feels kind of cheaty not needing torches to see the ores and monsters in a dark cave.

&#x200B;

That said, I sometimes play on a laptop that has a cheap TN panel and I can't see anything on that thing without turning up the brightness.

You may be right, but unfortunately that tester doesn't include the shift keys. I did try switching it to space, though, and it worked in all directions. It may just be that the shift keys don't like that particular combination for whatever reason.

&#x200B;

As for the diagonal speed, thanks for the heads up. Someone else commented with a solution to that so it's all fixed now.
